                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "search",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Filter templates using RSQL syntax. Combine expressions with `;` (AND) or `,` (OR).\n\n**Filterable fields:**\n\n| Field | Type | Operators |\n|-------|------|-----------|\n| `name` | string | `==` `!=` `=in=` `=out=` `=regex=` `=contains=` |\n| `created_at` | date | `==` `!=` `=in=` `=out=` `=gt=` `=ge=` `=lt=` `=le=` |\n| `updated_at` | date | `==` `!=` `=in=` `=out=` `=gt=` `=ge=` `=lt=` `=le=` |\n| `entity_id` | string | `==` `!=` `=in=` `=out=` `=regex=` |\n\n**Examples:**\n- `name==MyTemplate;entity_id==a6b45428-0296-4394-8ddd-0b50b5b20aa9`\n- `name==TemplateName`"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "order_criteria",
                  "value": "<string>"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "order_by",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "The ordering sequence of the selected templates If not selected then Descending order is the default order."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "page_number",
                  "value": "<number>",
                  "description": "A filter query in RSQL format to retrieve templates based on page number. If not selected then a default pageNumber is 1."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "page_size",
                  "value": "<number>",
                  "description": "A filter query in RSQL format to retrieve templates based on page size. If not selected then a default pageSize is 50"
                }
